<section style="padding:96px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Dieppe has grown faster than just about any city in New Brunswick, but plenty of homes in its older core still heat with oil. If your place is in Saint-Anselme or Chartersville, or on one of the streets off Champlain or Acadie, there's a good chance the tank beside your foundation has been there for decades. And when the insurance renewal shows up asking how old that tank is, it can feel like a fire drill.</p><p>Hub City Tank Co handles <a href="/oil-tank-replacement-moncton/">oil tank replacement</a> and <a href="/oil-tank-removal-moncton/">removal</a> across Dieppe and the rest of Greater Moncton. Estimates are free and in writing, we're licensed and insured, and our emergency line answers around the clock if a tank is leaking. Call (506) 802-3471 and we'll talk it through, no pressure.</p></div></div></section>
