        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Oil Tank Replacement</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We swap aging tanks in Dieppe homes for new certified units, usually in a single day. Most jobs in the older core are done before supper, with your heat back on the same afternoon.</p>
