        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Oil Tank Removal</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Switched to a heat pump or electric baseboard? We drain, disconnect, and haul away the old tank, and leave you the dated paperwork insurers and home buyers want to see.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
